{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A peaceful morning stroll has turned into the deadliest day of your life.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras/f2499049c5d23f71d030e4afc6024ed6.avif?t=1748314354\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras_big/f2499049c5d23f71d030e4afc6024ed6.avif?t=1748314354 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young woman living in a bucolic, peaceful Slavic village who is thrust into an apocalyptic scenario: a doomsday attack on her home.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras/98742d927f156efa9556e90383a1196d.avif?t=1748314354\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras_big/98742d927f156efa9556e90383a1196d.avif?t=1748314354 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running seems to be the only survivable option.<br>The dark depths of the nearby woods hide an even darker secret.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras/38e4186902ebda678f4d28b8c3a9249e.avif?t=1748314354\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras_big/38e4186902ebda678f4d28b8c3a9249e.avif?t=1748314354 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An encounter with a mysterious beast of a man in the woods leaves you in a heart-racing predicament. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras/5af680141bad0f5c924538b315f8daec.avif?t=1748314354\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398950/extras_big/5af680141bad0f5c924538b315f8daec.avif?t=1748314354 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find a way to escape him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you learn how to dig deeper, and earn the man's trust instead?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose a side; Don't look back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There's more to find, than meets the eye.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prologue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/ba02c418121e30d1420529c0416b25929225a8b7.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/c4babc2b2d9b513f6d2c30e2e71c388f588c55b8.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/5419e6d83be4ab7b6e78e5e009ddddd3a92f5457.jpg"},{"name":"Run For It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/c8d4b682aae33a0e0458aa50532441dad20c49df.jpg"},{"name":"You Died","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/ddb0f3c4de2c638748db7d09b3419d914dad16c2.jpg"},{"name":"Introductions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/358c6bacd08d4b5cd25f814ee0feff7ba5ae1b3d.jpg"},{"name":"Going Hunting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/8b7934f3036d9221d087359349d448352f9b5141.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Shooter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/b4eb67334265f37a7ffa7808873c62e80869bbbc.jpg"},{"name":"Close Enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3398950/e7f32397c26fff56cabad439997472893ac9fbf6.jpg"},{"name":"Recl